  <name>Linux OneDrive GUI</name>
  <summary>Sync OneDrive and SharePoint folders</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      A friendly front end for the OneDrive Client for Linux. Sign in with your Microsoft account,
      pick which folders to keep on your computer, and keep them in sync in the background.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Personal, work or school OneDrive accounts and SharePoint libraries</li>
      <li>Tray icon with live status, recent files, pause and "sync now"</li>
      <li>Choose folders, set sync schedules and speed limits</li>
      <li>Preview of every full resync before anything changes</li>
      <li>Copy sharing links from the file manager</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Not made by or affiliated with Microsoft. OneDrive is a trademark of Microsoft.</p>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">linux-onedrive-gui.desktop</launchable>
